# Generated artifacts produced by service/service-app/openapi/generate-client.sh.
#
# `linguist-generated=true` collapses these in GitHub pull request diffs
# so a review shows only hand-written changes rather than regenerated lines.
# It is a display hint only; it does not prevent edits.
#
# Everything under the client directory is script output, including the files
# that look hand-written. For example, LICENSE, README.md and pyproject.toml
# are copied verbatim from openapi/extras/ on every run, and edits in
# openapi/extras/ will still be picked up for review.
service/service-app/openapi.json linguist-generated=true
service/service-app/nvidia_attribution_client/** linguist-generated=true
